  "body": "Welcome to your private haven in the highly desirable Rothesay Bay, where contemporary design blends effortlessly with a relaxed beachside lifestyle. This impressive 4-bedroom residence is perfect for families wanting space, style, and a superb North Shore location.\r\n\r\nThe home showcases a light-filled open-plan living and dining area that flows seamlessly out to sun-soaked decks—ideal for entertaining, weekend BBQs, or simply unwinding outdoors.\r\n\r\nThe modern kitchen is a true highlight, fitted with premium Smeg appliances, sleek finishes, and quality cabinetry—making everyday cooking a pleasure.\r\n\r\nFour well-proportioned bedrooms offer comfort and privacy for the whole family, supported by two stylish bathrooms featuring underfloor heating for that extra touch of luxury. With double glazing, full insulation, and LED lighting throughout, you’ll enjoy a warm, energy-efficient home all year round.\r\n\r\nSitting on a freehold title, the property also includes a single garage providing secure and convenient parking.\r\n\r\nLocation is key—just a short walk to the beach (approx. 400m), and within zone for excellent schools including Browns Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate, and Rangitoto College.\r\n\r\nWith local cafes, eateries, shopping, and public transport all close by, this is a lifestyle opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nAct fast—get in touch today to arrange your viewing!",
